 The router backend is forked from GlobalProtect-openconnect
 (https://github.com/yuezk/GlobalProtect-openconnect, GPL-3.0)
 and statically links the OpenConnect library
 (https://gitlab.com/openconnect/openconnect, LGPL-2.1).
 The OpenConnect source is vendored in the NusaProtect source
 tree at router/crates/openconnect/deps/openconnect and can be
 rebuilt with `make backend`, which satisfies the LGPL
 relinking requirement.
